  "id": "grilled-salmon-sandwich-with-dill-sauce",
  "name": "Grilled Salmon Sandwich with Dill Sauce",
  "subtitle": "Toasted sandwiches with lemon-dill mayonnaise",
  "description": "Grilled salmon, crisp bacon, lettuce, and tomato layered on toasted bread with a bright dill sauce.",
